{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24025","headline":"咏兴五首 池上有小舟 · 白居易","name":"咏兴五首 池上有小舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池上有小舟，舟中有胡牀。\n牀前有新酒，独酌还独尝。\n熏若春日气，皎如秋水光。\n可洗机巧心，可荡尘垢肠。\n岸曲舟行迟，一曲进一觞。\n未知几曲醉，醉入无何乡。\n寅缘潭岛间，水竹深青苍。\n身闲心无事，白日爲我长。\n我若未忘世，虽闲心亦忙。\n世若未忘我，虽退身难藏。\n我今异於是，身世交相忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24025.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24025","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}